          "author": "Stephanie Leavell",
          "description": "Introducing \"Get Your Wiggles Out!\" with music therapist Stephanie Leavell, the creative force behind Music For Kiddos. This engaging playlist features nine movement songs designed to help kids channel their energy into positivity, silliness, and fun. \n\nThe music starts off active and gradually transitions to a calming finish, leaving little ones with a more regulated nervous system, ready to take on whatever comes next. Perfect for playtime, transitions, or winding down, this collection is a must-have for parents, educators, and anyone looking to bring joyful movement into children's lives.  ",
